-white/10 border-t border-warm-gold/30 z-50\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 h-full flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><a class=\"relative w-32 h-8\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"The Portal\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-contain object-left\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fbrand%2Fportal-full.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fbrand%2Fportal-full.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fbrand%2Fportal-full.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fbrand%2Fportal-full.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fbrand%2Fportal-full.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fbrand%2Fportal-full.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fbrand%2Fportal-full.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fbrand%2Fportal-full.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fbrand%2Fportal-full.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></a></div><div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-6\"><a href=\"https://luis-gilberto.com\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-gray-500 hover:text-white tracking-tight transition-colors\">Portfolio</a><a href=\"https://luis-gilberto.com/insights/\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-gray-500 hover:text-white tracking-tight transition-colors\">Insights</a><a href=\"https://luis-gilberto.com/TheHub/\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-gray-500 hover:text-white tracking-tight transition-colors\">The Hub</a><a class=\"text-sm font-bold text-[#F96F6E] tracking-tight\" href=\"/\">The Portal</a></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-loader-circle animate-spin text-gray-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 12a9 9 0 1 1-6.219-8.56\"></path></svg></div><button class=\"md:hidden flex flex-col gap-1.5 p-2 z-50 relative\"><span class=\"w-6 h-0.5 bg-white transition-all duration-300 \"></span><span class=\"w-6 h-0.5 bg-white transition-all duration-300 \"></span><span class=\"w-6 h-0.5 bg-white transition-all duration-300 \"></span></button></div></div></nav><main class=\"flex-grow pt-16 flex flex-col relative z-10\"><main class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-10 space-y-8\"><header class=\"space-y-3\"><h1 class=\"text-3xl font-bold\">Portal Changelog</h1><p class=\"text-[var(--text-secondary)]\">Version <!-- -->0.1.0<!-- --> · Deployed to <!-- -->Cloudflare Workers (OpenNext)</p></header><section class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--card-bg)] p-4\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-2\">Highlights</h2><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"text-sm\"><span class=\"font-medium\">Global navigation polish and mobile drawer</span><span class=\"text-[var(--text-secondary)]\"> — <!-- -->Clear ecosystem links and streamlined Portal access on mobile</span></li><li class=\"text-sm\"><span class=\"font-medium\">Authentication flows (sign in, sign up, verify)</span><span class=\"text-[var(--text-secondary)]\"> — <!-- -->Secure access with NextAuth + Prisma adapter</span></li><li class=\"text-sm\"><span class=\"font-medium\">Dashboard overview</span><span class=\"text-[var(--text-secondary)]\"> — <!-- -->At-a-glance status with navigation to key areas</span></li><li class=\"text-sm\"><span class=\"font-medium\">Projects: list, detail, and create</span><span class=\"text-[var(--text-secondary)]\"> — <!-- -->Organize initiatives and track work by project</span></li><li class=\"text-sm\"><span class=\"font-medium\">Documents area</span><span class=\"text-[var(--text-secondary)]\"> — <!-- -->Centralized client assets with consistent UI</span></li><li class=\"text-sm\"><span class=\"font-medium\">Messages module</span><span class=\"text-[var(--text-secondary)]\"> — <!-- -->Consolidated communication surface inside Portal</span></li><li class=\"text-sm\"><span class=\"font-medium\">StrategyIQ assessments + KB modal</span><span class=\"text-[var(--text-secondary)]\"> — <!-- -->Structured evaluation with contextual knowledge base</span></li><li class=\"text-sm\"><span class=\"font-medium\">Admin surface</span><span class=\"text-[var(--text-secondary)]\"> — <!-- -->Administrative controls for accounts and platform</span></li><li class=\"text-sm\"><span class=\"font-medium\">Session provider and middleware</span><span class=\"text-[var(--text-secondary)]\"> — <!-- -->Stable auth context and protected routes</span></li><li class=\"text-sm\"><span class=\"font-medium\">Deployment config and scripts</span><span class=\"text-[var(--text-secondary)]\"> — <!-- -->Repeatable builds and worker deployment via OpenNext</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--card-bg)] p-4 flex items-center justify-center\"><img alt=\"Portal\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"280\" height=\"80\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimages%2FThe_Portal_Logo.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimages%2FThe_Portal_Logo.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimages%2FThe_Portal_Logo.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75\"/></div></section><section class=\"rounded-xl border border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--card-bg)] p-4\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-2\">Screens &amp; Examples</h2><ul class=\"text-sm space-y-2\"><li><a class=\"text-[var(--coral)]\" href=\"/dashboard\">Dashboard</a> — overview and quick navigation</li><li><a class=\"text-[var(--coral)]\" href=\"/projects\">Projects</a> — active projects list</li><li><a class=\"text-[var(--coral)]\" href=\"/documents\">Documents</a> — client assets</li><li><a class=\"text-[var(--coral)]\" href=\"/strategyiq\">StrategyIQ</a> — assessments and KB modal</li><li><a class=\"text-[var(--coral)]\" href=\"/admin\">Admin</a> — admin controls</li><li><a class=\"text-[var(--coral)]\" href=\"/auth/signin\">Sign In</a> — authentication entry</li></ul></section><section class=\"rounded-xl border border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--card-bg)] p-4\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-2\">Deployment</h2><ul class=\"text-sm space-y-2\"><li>Target: <!-- -->Cloudflare Workers (OpenNext)<!-- --> via <code>@opennextjs/cloudflare</code> and <code>wrangler</code></li><li>Scripts: <code>npm run preview</code>, <code>npm run deploy</code></li><li>Auth &amp; data: NextAuth + Prisma (see <code>lib/auth.ts</code>, <code>prisma/schema.prisma</code>)</li></ul></section><section class=\"rounded-xl border border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--card-bg)] p-4\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-2\">Known Issues</h2><ul class=\"text-sm space-y-2\"><li>Autoplay limitations for media, depending on browser policies</li><li>Edge cases in project detail routes when unauthenticated</li><li>Deployment preview may differ from local dev styling due to worker runtime</li></ul></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"bg-[var(--bg-primary)] border-t border-[var(--border-subtle)] pt-16 pb-10 mt-auto\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr] gap-12 mb-12\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><img src=\"/assets/images/coral_white.png\" alt=\"Luis Gilberto\" class=\"h-12 w-12 object-contain opacity-90\"/><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-muted)] max-w-xs\">Making technology feel human through clarity, beautiful execution, and systems that scale.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><h4 class=\"font-big-shoulders text-base font-bold text-[var(--coral)] uppercase tracking-wide\">Work</h4><a href=\"https://luis-gilberto.com/myexperience.html\" class=\"text-sm text-[var(--text-secondary)] hover:text-[var(--coral)] transition-colors\">Experience</a><a href=\"https://luis-gilberto.com/timeline.html\" class=\"text-sm text-[var(--text-secondary)] hover:text-[var(--coral)] transition-colors\">Timeline</a><a href=\"https://luis-gilberto.com/myexperience.html#stories\" class=\"text-sm text-[var(--text-secondary)] hover:text-[var(--coral)] transition-colors\">Stories</a></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><h4 class=\"font-big-shoulders text-base font-bold text-[var(--coral)] uppercase tracking-wide\">About</h4><a href=\"https://luis-gilberto.com/about.html\" class=\"text-sm text-[var(--text-secondary)] hover:text-[var(--coral)] transition-colors\">About Me</a><a href=\"https://luis-gilberto.com/cv.html\" class=\"text-sm text-[var(--text-secondary)] hover:text-[var(--coral)] transition-colors\">Resume</a><a href=\"https://luis-gilberto.com/insights\" class=\"text-sm text-[var(--text-secondary)] hover:text-[var(--coral)] transition-colors\">Insights</a></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><h4 class=\"font-big-shoulders text-base font-bold text-[var(--coral)] uppercase tracking-wide\">Connect</h4><a href=\"https://luis-gilberto.com/contact.html\" class=\"text-sm text-[var(--text-secondary)] hover:text-[var(--coral)] transition-colors\">Contact</a><a href=\"https://linkedin.com/in/luisgilberto00\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-sm text-[var(--text-secondary)] hover:text-[var(--coral)] transition-colors\">LinkedIn</a><a href=\"mailto:hello@luis-gilberto.com\" class=\"text-sm text-[var(--text-secondary)] hover:text-[var(--coral)] transition-colors\">Email</a></div></div></div><div class=\"pt-8 border-t border-[var(--border-subtle)] flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4\"><div class=\"flex gap-4\"><a href=\"https://linkedin.com/in/luisgilberto00\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"LinkedIn\" class=\"w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[var(--bg-alt